# Remove nullability for the {{growth_automation_config_id}}; add nullability to the {{growth_automation_config_uuid}};
# Update the backend/frontend to use exclusively {{growth_automation_config_id}};
# Check all logic's correctness and ensure there are no weird errors; remove {{growth_automation_config_uuid}} if you are sure everything is okay.

