Repeat rides information can be caught from the profilings aggregation same as in driver_period_check: 

* {{additional.weekly.repetitiveCount}} 
* {{additional.weekly.orderCount}} 
* {{additional.weekly.repetitiveCount}} / {{additional.weekly.orderCount}} 

AND/OR

* {{additional.weekly.sameCount}} 
* {{additional.weekly.orderCount}} 
* {{additional.weekly.sameCount}}/{{additional.weekly.orderCount}}  

*_Mock Rule Concept:_* 

:purple_star: {color:#403294} {color}{color:#403294}*AML_DRIVER_PRE_ARRANGED_VOLUME* {color}:purple_star:

* {{additional.weekly.orderCount}} >= 10
* {{additional.weekly.sameCount}} /  {{additional.weekly.orderCount}}   >= 0.5 
OR 
* {{additional.weekly.repetitiveCount}} /  {{additional.weekly.orderCount}}   >= 0.5

Best:
* {{additional.weekly.repetitiveCount}} or {{additional.weekly.sameCount}} /  {{additional.weekly.orderCount}}   >= 0.5

