ype":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"If so, can you give a link to a mentioned "},{"type":"text","text":"‘Bolt’s default audit log","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"’ page?"}]},{"type":"orderedList","attrs":{"order":1},"content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"mention","attrs":{"id":"712020:13033e65-435c-4794-a380-e007eba7615a","accessLevel":"","localId":"bf761834-99fd-40b3-bf99-946db4a9ac7c"}},{"type":"text","text":" can you please ask them to confirm i) they will track it; ii) give a link to the page where it would be stored?"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I believe we may skip this as of now as this is a really low-risk data of switching the profile from one model to another, but it may require a lot of resources if these is not tracked by the Driver X Team."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"mention","attrs":{"id":"712020:13033e65-435c-4794-a380-e007eba7615a","accessLevel":"","localId":"f23861e0-9813-4619-876a-b78c481922b7"}},{"type":"text","text":" to "},{"type":"mention","attrs":{"id":"641d5e830e6828ab20269e6d","accessLevel":"","localId":"0f3aed94-932e-4be7-b799-b601b4819b61"}},{"type":"text","text":" "}]},{"type":"orderedList","attrs":{"order":1},"content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I believe DriverX were referring to the change logs of a profile on Admin."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Agreed. Flagging for completeness, but this is low priority."}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colwidth":[144],"background":"#ffffff"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Invoices","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colwidth":[98],"background":"#ffffff"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Drivers"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colwidth":[263],"background":"#ffffff"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Drivers will be able to switch between their agency model profile and principal model profile freely. The driver will only be able to access the invoices applicable to a particular profile when logged into that particular profile."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Under the agency model, drivers will have rider invoices and commission invoices. Under the principal model, drivers will have both rider invoices and resale invoices."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Also, where substitution takes place for a trip, the invoice will only be issued to the driver that ended up completing the trip."}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colwidth":[212],"background":"#ffffff"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Under the agency model, we should provide both rider and commission invoices to drivers. Under the principal model, we should only provide resale invoices to the driver (as rider invoices are between Bolt and the rider). We need to make sure that our new "},{"type":"text","text":"invoice extraction tool","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/billing-bulk-invoice-download/items?tz=Europe%2FTallinn&filter=%7B%22limit%22%3A25%2C%22offset%22%3A0%2C%22filter%22%3A%7B%7D%7D"}},{"type":"underline"}]},{"type":"text","text":" caters for this difference."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"We should also ensure that a driver acting as a substitute driver does not cause any issues with extracting their invoices."}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colwidth":[327],"background":"#e3fcef"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Check with the engineers whether the new bulk download tool will cover this difference, particularly in a Project Green context."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"We should also ensure our DSAR guidance is updated accordingly."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"mention","attrs":{"id":"712020:13033e65-435c-4794-a380-e007eba7615a","accessLevel":"","localId":"07af7ed7-570a-42fc-8fc2-71eadaa69c52"}},{"type":"text","text":" , can you please ask Artem from the Billing Team to confirm your assumption above? We recently discussed the differences in models."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"mention","attrs":{"id":"641d5e830e6828ab20269e6d","accessLevel":"","localId":"c8ef38e5-14c7-485d-9abb-bb07dd97ad7f"}},{"type":"text","text":" :"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"For the export tool, each data owner team is responsible for building plugins (functionality that will gather data from the system in a structured format and show it to the requester). In this case, the Billing team needs to confirm they have a plugin for these invoices."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"If so, we need to ask them to add it to the PDE (Export tool)"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"TH UPDATE (29.05): DONE.","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything should already be covered in the plugin. Provided we use driver IDs rather than partner IDs, then should be fine."}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colwidth":[144],"background":"#ffffff"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Invitation emails","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colwidth":[98],"background":"#ffffff"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Drivers"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colwidth":[263],"background":"#ffffff"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"When a driver (Driver A) wants to invite another driver (Driver B) to act as their substitute, they will enter Driver B’s contact information into Bolt’s system and Bolt will send an invitation email to Driver B."}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colwidth":[212],"background":"#ffffff"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"We need to ensure that such invitation emails are included in Driver B’s emails export."}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colwidth":[327],"background":"#ffbdad"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Check with engineers that invitations emails of this kind will be included in the ‘emails’ data export."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"mention","attrs":{"id":"641d5e830e6828ab20269e6d","accessLevel":"","localId":"db4bb944-72c7-4d45-95d7-969d15414ed1"}},{"type":"text","text":" to "},{"type":"mention","attrs":{"id":"712020:13033e65-435c-4794-a380-e007eba7615a","accessLevel":"","localId":"ab33d17f-ff48-41df-bf34-4381475ad518"}},{"type":"text","text":" :"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This information need to be confirmed with Driver X and dev-comms-support Teams"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"mention","attrs":{"id":"712020:13033e65-435c-4794-a380-e007eba7615a","accessLevel":"","localId":"4d4417b3-f898-43bc-a3f0-b9ab43b20299"}},{"type":"text","text":" , can you please ask Driver X team on whether these emails will be sent using the Platform-Comms team or Lifecycle team?"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"If Comms Team, I will make a request to them to confirm these emails will be included."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"If LCM, we do not support these emails in the export tool yet."}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"UPDATE (02.06): ","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":"LCM team will be responsible for sending these emails. As such, these are not currently included in the export tool. This is low priority, but should be flagged as a compliance risk / gap."}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colwidth":[144],"background":"#ffffff"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Compliance documents","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colwidth":[98],"background":"#ffffff"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Drivers"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colwidth":[263],"background":"#ffffff"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"When a driver (Driver B) accepts an invitation to act as a substitute driver on behalf of another driver (Driver A), and Driver B is not already a Bolt driver, they need to submit to Bolt the usual list of documents that they would ordinarily provide in order to driver with Bolt."}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colwidth":[212],"background":"#ffffff"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Presumably such documents would be include as part of the usual ‘documents’ export. However, we need to double-check this is the case due to the new Admin setup with multiple active profiles."}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colwidth":[327],"background":"#e3fcef"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Flag this to engineers and ensure that such documents would be included in Driver B’s documents export."}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"mention","attrs":{"id":"712020:13033e65-435c-4794-a380-e007eba7615a","accessLevel":"","localId":"c06a86b4-4181-41d9-8045-44450995ae3b"}},{"type":"text","text":" can you please confirm it with the Driver Growth Conversion Team ("},{"type":"text","text":"Afolashakin Ajayi","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"text","text":"Alexander Fokau)","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":" that these docs will be a part of all documents they added to the export tool?"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"UPDATE (16.06): DONE","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Since the export tool will work by both partner and driver IDs, theoretically this should automatically be included. It is worth checking that this is the case once Project Green is live, for completeness."}]}]}]}]}]}]}
